SUMMARY:Enniamera of the Virgin\, Tripodes
LOCATION:Tripodes (Vivlos)\, Naxos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Nine days after the Dormition\, Tripodes (Vivlos)\, the windmill village above Plaka beach\, holds the Enniamera feast with tables in the square\, wine and live island music. It is the closest big village panigiri to the west-coast beaches and a good one if you are staying around Agios Prokopios or Plaka.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/naxos/#tripodes-vivlos-enniamera-of-the-virgin-tripodes
